{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1V_rc-7tB6Xy6wLyuegLaA?click_id=112","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:05.309062+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1V_rc-7tB6Xy6wLyuegLaA?click_id=112","html":"<div><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugYrhyeHA7ZSxXuPsHiafcFOoWsuhpNNFdEnrbqorLk4pVrZSSic36IYJQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span><span>热忱欢迎全国各地优秀学子申请加入江西财经大学国际经济与政治学院大家庭！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugtYjwoR1NIkUnT4yXf8kgdBCFxleHJQ78GVIQzAicUSkEKE2VGVFHFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>一、可接收推免生硕士点</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.国际贸易学：学术学位、全日制、学制三年、学费8000元/年。</span></span></p></section><p><span><span><span>　　2.国际商务：专业学位、全日制、学制两年、学费12000元/年。</span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugtYjwoR1NIkUnT4yXf8kgdBCFxleHJQ78GVIQzAicUSkEKE2VGVFHFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>二、申请对象</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p><span><span><span>　　1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化国家建设服务，品行端正，遵纪守法。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　2.已获得或预计能获得所在高校2025年推荐免试攻读硕士研究生资格的应届本科毕业生。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　3.考生身体状况应符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　4.本科专业为经济学类、管理学类、数学类、计算机类、统计学类、地理学类等。</span></span></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugIVW3KrhG6iaBb8WPYMc2F03mNoA30soN4URViaWjna0ibpQYmgfoyVg5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugtYjwoR1NIkUnT4yXf8kgdBCFxleHJQ78GVIQzAicUSkEKE2VGVFHFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>三、申请材料</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　1.本科阶段成绩单扫描件（需加盖所在学校教务部门公章）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　2.大学英语四级、六级、雅思等体现英语水平的成绩单扫描件。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　3.各类获奖证书和学术论文等科研成果材料扫描件。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　4.个人简历</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　将上述材料压缩成一个文件夹并命名“姓名-申请专业-联系电话”，于2025年9月21日前将上述要求的电子材料提交到专用邮箱63469979@qq.com。</span></span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugvVU78AK52xMGvm8iaQQyXxhDHT4UrdI86ky4RxwJPDYtdUa22qJcKdg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugtYjwoR1NIkUnT4yXf8kgdBCFxleHJQ78GVIQzAicUSkEKE2VGVFHFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>四、奖助学金体系</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>　　包括学业奖学金、国家助学金、国家奖学金、江西省政府奖学金、校长奖学金、各类企业奖学金、研究生助学金、“三助”岗位津贴等多项奖助学金。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugtYjwoR1NIkUnT4yXf8kgdBCFxleHJQ78GVIQzAicUSkEKE2VGVFHFSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>五、注意事项</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><ol></ol><p><span><span><span>　　1.预报名阶段时间从即日起至9月21日止，请有意者尽早报名。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　2.学院研究生招生工作小组对申请人材料进行初审并及时反馈。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　3.请申请者务必提供自身准确有效的联系方式，以免错失机会。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>　　4.欢迎电话咨询 0791-83976917  胡老师</span></span></span></p></section><section><p><span><span><span>江西财经大学国际经济与政治学院</span></span></span></p><p><span>2025年9月11日　</span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugneMTw9ekekIMcnmbeWoW857ute3pzwV0tcOLeGibWyicyX5ILqDfj2ag/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugQdjPb6VweZXS0AH7saN9iaGeZtBgKZbE2nrAQU6QXFQk40cTn0MX9fA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><strong><span><span>国际经济与政治学院网新办</span></span></strong></section></section><p><span><strong><span><span>荣誉出品</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span>编辑 | 易希谨</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>责任编辑 | 曲晨飞</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>审核 | 周妍</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/riaoBuLFbkEuD20eZysibI6RueooIuYlugMicBBKpVfkNSicsBCsH1KVfwuDRNyOicWQ028gU6Nqp5OU3ia0dpRSs3dw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a10f8f9f84ffd2ade925362ffad0e490f46b0cdbc46337228601b89c63403a66","textLength":676,"sourceSha256":"1a22d58fc8b5babf493c6f14941b8accff646df82a41b52f58b6c6e0e3a9797b","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-80a76000a995b112afc2","title":"2025年年江西财经大学国际经济贸易与政治学院关于接收2026级研究生推免生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:05.309062+00:00"}
